4:T44e,<h2>How Fast Will My Order Arrive?</h2><p>We process most orders within one business day. Standard shipping typically takes 5-7 business days from dispatch, so you're looking at about a week total door-to-door.</p><h3>Shipping Options</h3><ul><li><strong>Standard (5-7 days):</strong> $5.99 — free over $75</li><li><strong>Express (2-3 days):</strong> $12.99</li><li><strong>Overnight (next day):</strong> $24.99</li></ul><h2>International Shipping</h2><p>We ship to over 40 countries. Rates and delivery times vary by destination, and you'll see the final cost at checkout. We declare the actual value on customs forms — we can't mark packages as gifts.</p><h2>Tracking Your Package</h2><p>You'll get a shipping confirmation email with a tracking number as soon as your order leaves our warehouse. You can also view tracking from your account page.</p><h2>Problems with Delivery?</h2><p>If your package hasn't arrived within 10 business days of shipment, reach out and we'll help figure out what happened. Lost or damaged packages are covered — we'll either send a replacement or refund you.</p>0:{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Pages\",\"item\":\"http://localhost:3000/pages\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Shipping & Delivery Details\",\"item\":\"http://localhost:3000/pages/shipping-delivery\"}]}"}}],["$","nav",null,{"aria-label":"breadcrumb","data-slot":"breadcrumb","className":"","children":["$","ol",null,{"data-slot":"breadcrumb-list","className":"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 text-sm wrap-break-word text-muted-foreground","children":[["$","li",null,{"data-slot":"breadcrumb-item","className":"inline-flex items-center gap-1","children":["$"